# RC-008 — Typography & Reading Comfort

North star: **Every paragraph invites calm attention.**

## Before touching text ask

- Does body copy use `ReadingTypography.body()` — not ad-hoc `copyWith(height: …)`?
- Do reflections use `ReadingTypography.reflection()` or `closing()`?
- Do section labels use `ReadingTypography.sectionLabel()`?
- Is paragraph spacing `CraftsmanshipRhythm.paragraphGap` in long content?
- Are secondary colors `textSecondary` / `textHint` / `textMuted` — not custom alpha hacks?

If any answer is no — revise.

## Canonical doc

`docs/RC-008.md`

## Out of scope

Redesign · new features · walls of text

## Success

Reading feels peaceful. Scrolling encourages continued reading, not fatigue.
